const thMonths=['มกราคม','กุมภาพันธ์','มีนาคม','เมษายน','พฤษภาคม','มิถุนายน','กรกฎาคม','สิงหาคม','กันยายน','ตุลาคม','พฤศจิกายน','ธันวาคม'];
const thDaysShort=['อา','จ','อ','พ','พฤ','ศ','ส'];

let calYear, calMonth;
(function initCal(){
  const now=new Date();
  calYear=now.getFullYear(); calMonth=now.getMonth();
  renderCal();
})();

function calNav(dir){
  calMonth+=dir;
  if(calMonth>11){calMonth=0;calYear++;}
  if(calMonth<0){calMonth=11;calYear--;}
  renderCal();
}

function renderCal(){
  const now=new Date(); now.setHours(0,0,0,0);
  const title=document.getElementById('calTitle');
  const grid=document.getElementById('calGrid');
  const prevBtn=document.getElementById('calPrev');

  title.textContent=`${thMonths[calMonth]} ${calYear+543}`;

  // Disable prev if we're already at current month
  const isCurrentMonth=(calYear===now.getFullYear()&&calMonth===now.getMonth());
  prevBtn.disabled=isCurrentMonth;

  // First day of month (0=Sun)
  const firstDow=new Date(calYear,calMonth,1).getDay();
  // Total days in month
  const daysInMonth=new Date(calYear,calMonth+1,0).getDate();

  let html='';
  // Empty cells before first day
  for(let i=0;i<firstDow;i++) html+=`<div class="cal-day empty"></div>`;

  for(let d=1;d<=daysInMonth;d++){
    const date=new Date(calYear,calMonth,d);
    const dow=date.getDay(); // 0=Sun,1=Mon
    const isPast=date<now;
    const isMon=dow===1;
    const isToday=date.getTime()===now.getTime();

    // Format yyyy-mm-dd
    const dateStr=`${calYear}-${String(calMonth+1).padStart(2,'0')}-${String(d).padStart(2,'0')}`;
    const isSelected=S.date===dateStr;

    let cls='cal-day';
    if(isPast) cls+=' disabled';
    else if(isMon) cls+=' closed-day';
    else if(isToday) cls+=' today';
    if(isSelected) cls+=' selected';

    const label=isMon?'ปิด':String(d);
    const clickable=!isPast&&!isMon;
    html+=`<div class="${cls}" ${clickable?`onclick="selectDate('${dateStr}',${dow})"`:''} title="${dateStr}">${label}</div>`;
  }
  grid.innerHTML=html;
}

function selectDate(dateStr, dow){
